'''Raygun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was obtainable by purchasing the 25th tier in the battle pass for 90,000 [[Candies (2025)|'''Candies''']] {{Currency|Candies2025}}during the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended. 

== Appearance ==
It’s a black and gray ray gun with bright green details. It has a small green orb at the back instead of a hammer, and a long green line runs through the side of the barrel. A green circular detail sits on the tip of the gun. There is a black fin on top of the gun, and the handle has gray panels.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the godly knife [[Alienbeam]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Alien Set|Alien Set]].
* It has a chroma counterpart called [[Chroma Raygun]].
* This, [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Gingerscope]], [[Chroma Raygun]], [[Snowcannon]], and [[Chroma Snowcannon]] are the only guns to have a unique trail and shooting sound effect.
** Additionally, this is the first godly gun to have a unique trail and shooting sound effect.

